# Normalize text to LF in the repository, the working tree, and exported archives.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf decides the line endings and a build from the working tree
# produces different bytes than a build from `git archive`, so the same tracked source
# yields two different wheels. Pinning eol=lf makes the stored blob authoritative for all
# three, which is what makes a wheel reproducible from source alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Build and packaging inputs that are never text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
